# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client + Next.js Route Handlers)
# Copy this file to .env.local and replace the placeholder below with your key.
#
# Quickstart for Prototyping (Maps Demo Key — zero billing setup required):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any personal Google account.
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate and copy your Maps Demo Key.
# 5. Paste it into .env.local as NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY.
#
# Note: Maps Demo Key has daily quota limits and is for prototyping only.
# For production, create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional: Dedicated server-side API key for /api/places/search and /api/elevation Route Handlers
# (If omitted, Route Handlers fall back to NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY)
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_server_side_google_maps_api_key_here
